✔ D-051: an isolated success does not wipe earned backoff, through the real CLI (5759.821791ms)
✔ inbox --follow attests only rendered broadcasts in batches of at most 50 (580.141917ms)
✔ D-051/D-055/D-056: a refused read is tolerated a bounded number of times, then exits with a frame (5655.485667ms)
✔ D-056: the exit status separates a refusal from a revoked credential (1104.34875ms)
